वि-√ पच् P. -पचति, to cook thoroughly, dissolve by cooking or boiling, KātyŚr.; Suśr. ;
 Pass. -पच्यते, to be cooked or baked or roasted, MBh.;
to be digested, ib.;
to be completely matured or ripened or developed, Ragh.; Suśr.;
to bear fruit, develop consequences, VarBṛS. :
Caus. -पाचयति, to cook thoroughly, dissolve by cooking, melt, liquefy, Suśr.

वि-√ पत् P. -पतति, to fly or dash or rush through, RV. i, 168, 6;
to fly apart, fall off, burst asunder, be divided or separated, ŚBr.; ChUp.;
to fly along, RV. x, 96, 9 :
Caus. -पतयति, to fly in various directions, RV. iii, 55, 3;
to fall asunder, be opened, ib. vi, 9, 6;
 -पातयति, to cause to fly away, shoot off (arrows), AV.;
to cause to fly asunder or off, split or strike off (a head), ib.;
to strike down, kill, MBh.

वि-√ पद् Ā. -पद्यते, to fall or burst asunder, MBh. xi, 95;
to come between, intervene, prevent, hinder, Kauś.;
to go wrongly, fail, miscarry, come to nought, perish, die, ṢaḍvBr.; MBh. &c.:
Caus. पादयति, to cause to perish, destroy, kill, Rājat.

वि-परि-√ वृत् Ā. -वर्तते, to turn round, revolve, Bhag.;
to roll (on the ground), Mn. vi, 22;
to move about, roam, wander, MBh.;
 &c.;
to turn round or back, return, MBh.;
to be transformed, change, alter, ib.;
to visit or afflict continually, ib. :
Caus. -वर्तयति, to cause to turn round or revolve, turn round or away, Lāṭy.; MBh. &c.

वि-पर्य्-√ अस् Ā. -अस्यते, to turn over, turn round, overturn, reverse, invert, ŚBr.; Gaut.;
to change, interchange, exchange, KātyŚr.;
to have a wrong notion, be in error, Bhartṛ. :
Caus. -आसयति, to cause to turn round or to change, Bālar.

वि-√ पृच् P. -पृणक्ति (Impv. -पृङ्क्तम् Pot. -पपृच्यात् inf. -पृ॑चे), to isolate, separate from (instr.), VS.;
to scatter, dispel, RV. iv, 13, 3;
to fill, satiate, ib. iv, 24, 5.

वि-प्र-√ कृ P. -करोति, to treat with disrespect, hurt, injure, offend, oppress, MBh.; R. &c.;
to appoint, admit (साक्ष्ये, as a witness), MBh. v, 1225 (prob. w.r. for अधि-√ कृ) :
Pass. of Caus. -कार्यते, to be slighted or injured or treated disrespectfully, MW.

P. -णश्यति, -णशति, to be lost, perish, disappear, Yājñ.; MBh.;
to have no effect or result, bear no fruit, MBh. :
Caus. -णाशयति, to cause to be lost or perish, SaddhP.

वि-प्रति-√ पद् Ā. -पद्यते, to go in different or opposite directions, turn here and there, ŚBr.;
to roam, wander (said of the senses), Kād.;
to be perplexed or confounded, be uncertain how to act, waver, hesitate, MBh.;
to differ or diverge in opinion, be mutually opposed, Śaṃk.;
to be mistaken, have a false opinion about (loc.), Car.;
to reply falsely or erroneously, Nyāyas., Sch.

वि-√ प्रथ् P. Ā. -प्रथति, ˚ते, (P.) to spread (trans.), RV. vi, 72, 2;
 (Ā.) to spread out, extend (intrans.), be wide, RV.; TS.; Hcar. :
Caus. -प्रथयति, spread out or abroad, celebrate, RV.; MBh.;
to unfold, display, exhibit, MBh.

वि-प्र-√ मुच् P. -मुञ्चति, to loosen, unfasten, take off, MBh.;
to liberate, set free, ib.;
to discharge, hurl, shoot, R. :
Pass. -मुच्यते, to be liberated or released from (abl.), get off free, MBh.; Kāv.; Pur.

वि-प्र-√ लभ् Ā. -लभते, to insult, violate, to mock at, take in, cheat, deceive, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to regain, recover, MBh. (B.) xiv, 1732 (C. प्र-वि-ल्˚, prob. w.r. for प्रति-ल्˚) :
Caus. -लम्भयति, to mock, insult, violate, BhP.

वि-प्र-√ 5. वस् P. -वसति, to set out on a journey, go or dwell abroad, GṛŚrS.; Mn.; MBh. :
Caus. -वासयति, to cause to dwell away, banish, expel from (abl.), Mn.; Yājñ.; MBh.;
to take away, remove, R.

वि-√ प्लु Ā. -प्लवते (mc. also P.), to float asunder, drift about, be dispersed or scattered, TS.; MBh.;
to fall into disorder or confusion, go astray, be lost or ruined, perish, MBh.; Kāv. &c.:
Caus. -प्लावयति, to cause to swim or float about, Kauś.;
 to spread abroad, make known, divulge, Mn. xi, 198;
to bring to ruin or calamity, waste, destroy, Śiś.; Bālar.;
 (-प्लव्˚), to perplex, confuse, confound, Kpr.
